{{Quote|Well, I'm not just any drone! I'm half-drone, half-'''human'''! Drones can adapt... and humans never give up!|Nanomech to the [[Decoy Queen]].<ref name="AS">'''''[[Ben 10: Alien Swarm]]'''''</ref>}}
'''Nanomech''' is the DNA sample of a [[Human (Classic)|Human]]/[[Microchip]] hybrid created by the [[Omnitrix]].{{Refn|Nanomech is stated to be a [[Human (Classic)|Human]]/[[Microchip]] hybrid in '''''[[Ben 10: Alien Swarm|Alien Swarm]]'''''.
*[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] considered Nanomech to be more of an evolved form of Microchip rather than a hybrid.{{Refn|[[:File:Microchip Evolution.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick Opinion on Nanomech.png]]|group = DJW}}
*The card included with Bandai's Nanomech action figure refers to him as both a Nanomechion from "hive" planets and a unique creation of the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]], fusing the bio-mechanical DNA of the Microchips with Ben.{{Refn|group = Bandai|name = DNAsource}}|group = note|name = species}}

==Appearance==
Nanomech is about a tiny creature, smaller than a human hand at full height.{{Refn|Due to inconsistency issues common to characters with unusual sizes, such as [[Way Big]], Nanomech's full size is somewhere between a few inches tall and a few centimetres depending on the episode.|group = note|name = height}} He has grey skin with a green circuit-like design on it. Nanomech possesses green wings as well as one large, green cyclopean-eye. His body is a carbon or silicon-based alloy,<ref>[[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin Levin]]</ref><ref name="AS"/> and he has triangular feet. He wore the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]]/[[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

In ''[[Video Games (Episode)|Video Games]]'', Nanomech wore a blue motion capture suit.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Nanomech's circuit design is gone, being replaced with one pushing more to his '''''[[Ben 10: Alien Swarm|Alien Swarm]]''''' design, and the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol is where his eye was. He has different wings and four small eyes around the Omnitrix, similar to [[Stinkfly (Classic)|Stinkfly]]. His legs have also changed shape, and his body now emits a bright green glow that completely surrounds him.

